{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26bd Soccer Field PRO 3D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soccer Field PRO 3D</strong> delivers an intense football experience with realistic physics, multiplayer matches, and full creative freedom. Build your team, pull off amazing dribbles, customize your players, and hit the field for fast-paced, competitive gameplay!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Highlights:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Smooth gameplay with responsive controls and precise action<br>\u2699\ufe0f Full customization of players and teams<br>\ud83d\udd04 Realistic ball physics, passing, and movement<br>\ud83d\udcda Interactive tutorial to get you started fast<br>\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Create your own room and play with friends<br>\ud83c\udf10 Real-time online multiplayer mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a scoring machine, a legendary goalkeeper, or the ultimate match host. <strong>Soccer Field PRO 3D</strong> is free to play, competitive, and addictive!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468160?t=1747250951","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468160/cc605103ee41b8d9d2e969015313830146b8595b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747250951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468160/bc9a4db98edb17ea83afca69700cf712ea09578b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747250951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468160/bc9a4db98edb17ea83afca69700cf712ea09578b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747250951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26bd Soccer Field PRO 3D</h2>